cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on the Blockchain Property Ontology (BPO), please cite it as below."
title: "Blockchain Property Ontology (BPO)"
abstract: >-
  A living, machine-readable ontology of the safety, liveness, security,
  economic, cryptographic, and governance properties that blockchain systems
  are expected to satisfy — with, for each property, a plain-language
  description, a formal specification, its failure modes and attack surface,
  the verification strategies that can honestly establish it, and its explicit
  assumptions and relationships to other properties.
